{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund free bus travel for children during all school holidays",
        "additional_details": "While the initiative providing free August bus travel for under-16s has given families a vital cost-of-living boost, household financial pressures do not stop when summer ends. Families can face intense financial strain during the October half-term, Christmas, Easter, and spring breaks. Extending free bus travel to all school holidays could permanently reduce family outgoings, lower traffic congestion, improve safety, and encourage long-term sustainable travel habits among young people.",
        "background": "We want the Government to provide funding to expand the free bus travel scheme for children to cover every school holiday break, rather than just the month of August.",
